    "title": "What grocery stores are open on Easter across Tampa Bay?",
    "text": "If you're scrambling for last-minute groceries, or just need to grab something on the go, knowing which stores will be open — and which won't — can save you a trip. TAMPA, Fla. — Easter Sunday falls on April 5 this year, and if the holiday arrives and you're scrambling for last-minute groceries, or just need to grab something on the go, knowing which stores will be open — and which won't — can save you a trip. While some grocery stores across Tampa Bay will be closed, you'll still be in luck, as a handful will still keep their doors open and/or have modified hours during the holiday. Here's what you need to know before you head out the door. Is Publix open on Easter? No, all Publix stores are closed on Easter. Is Target open on Easter? Is Walmart open on Easter? Yes, Walmart stores are open on Easter Sunday for 2026. Is Costco open on Easter? No, Costco is not open on Easter 2026. Easter Sunday is one of the seven holidays that Costco closes its U.S. warehouses. Is Aldi open on Easter? No, Aldi will be closed on Easter. Is Trader Joe's open on Easter? Yes, Trader Joe's locations will be open on Easter. Is Whole Foods open on Easter? Yes, Whole Foods will be open on Easter, but many locations will operate with modified hours. TEGNA Digital's Megan Divers contributed to this story.",
